Run python3 tools/prepare_ime.py to prepare the pinned 32-bit little-endian
Android PinyinIME system dictionary, decoder source and Apache 2.0 notices.

Deploy dict_pinyin.dat, LICENSE-2.0.txt and NOTICE.txt beside each other in
ime-data/ next to st. The terminal creates user.dat here for learned words;
preserve that file during upgrades. ST_IME_DICT and ST_IME_USER can override
these paths. Desktop 64-bit development dictionaries have a different ABI.
